## Implemented boundary

TeamPage now renders the durable `workflowPlans` projection and the client runtime owns a bounded `workflowPlans` collection cursor loaded through Host `team.workflow.plan.list`. The surface is read-only: it does not create/edit plans, and `team_workflow_*` tool authoring remains unchanged. Unbound templates remain visible without fabricated task links; bound templates link to their task detail; completed result count and failure reason are shown. SDK/Python wire parity, stale-read race coverage, and full browser/GIF coverage remain open, so F-UI-03 stays partial.
